<!-- ============================================================================
  Dual-arm URDF — "Astral Robot"

  Two identical 7-DOF arms mounted symmetrically on a shared torso.

  Kinematic tree:
    world
    └── ground_to_body → body_link (torso, shared)
        ├── left_shoulder_mount  → left_base_link  → left_joint1~7 → left_link1~7
